8200867c3","_id":15460},{"id":1779789507463,"text":"无语又怪我","sender":"me","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796221646,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15461},{"id":1779789507464,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.9, Past:0.9, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:45，岚城。陆驰刚走进卧室，听到提示音拿起手机。看到她理直气壮的控诉，他愣了一下，随即翻看了一下通话记录。刚才手指上沾着水，可能不小心碰到了挂断键。\"}","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.9, Past:0.9, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:45，岚城。陆驰刚走进卧室，听到提示音拿起手机。看到她理直气壮的控诉，他愣了一下，随即翻看了一下通话记录。刚才手指上沾着水，可能不小心碰到了挂断键。\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796233484,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15462},{"id":1779789507465,"text":"行，我的错。手指上有水滑了一下，不小心碰到了。","rawContent":"行，我的错。手指上有水滑了一下，不小心碰到了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796237985,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15463},{"id":1779789507466,"text":"我给你道歉，别无语。","rawContent":"我给你道歉，别无语。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796240745,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15464},{"id":1779789507467,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （嗓音带着点自知理亏的笑意）刚才光顾着看你那敷衍的表情，急着让你加衣服，没注意手上的动作。没怪你，怪我。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796241647,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（嗓音带着点自知理亏的笑意）刚才光顾着看你那敷衍的表情，急着让你加衣服，没注意手上的动作。没怪你，怪我。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15465},{"id":1779789507468,"text":"既然没啥事出门逛逛，那就好好逛。","rawContent":"既然没啥事出门逛逛，那就好好逛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796244832,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15466},{"id":1779789507469,"text":"记得把我刚才的啰嗦都听进去，围巾帽子戴好。到了发个定位，我就不烦你了，去吹个头发准备睡觉。","rawContent":"记得把我刚才的啰嗦都听进去，围巾帽子戴好。到了发个定位，我就不烦你了，去吹个头发准备睡觉。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796249333,"roundId":"round_1779796226756_lo0xruugi","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15467},{"id":1779789507470,"text":"你这是道歉的态度吗","sender":"me","time":"19:50","timestamp":1779796255742,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15468},{"id":1779789507471,"text":"表情包：讨厌你（委屈）","sender":"me","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796260798,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15469,"stickerRef":"s18jll9n_h1n"},{"id":1779789507472,"text":"不和你说了出门了","sender":"me","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796268208,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15470},{"id":1779789507473,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.9, Past:0.9, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:48，岚城。陆驰坐在床沿，看着屏幕上那个委屈的表情包，无奈地叹了口气，眼角眉梢却全是宠溺。他把手机换到另一只手，拿毛巾胡乱擦了两下头发。\"}","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.9, Past:0.9, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:48，岚城。陆驰坐在床沿，看着屏幕上那个委屈的表情包，无奈地叹了口气，眼角眉梢却全是宠溺。他把手机换到另一只手，拿毛巾胡乱擦了两下头发。\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796286224,"roundId":"round_1779796268693_8gmb9v1qd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15471},{"id":1779789507474,"text":"怎么还委屈上了？怪我，我态度不端正。","rawContent":"怎么还委屈上了？怪我，我态度不端正。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796289470,"roundId":"round_1779796268693_8gmb9v1qd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15472},{"id":1779789507475,"text":"等29号落地了，我让你亲身“检验”一下什么叫有诚意的道歉，行不行？","rawContent":"等29号落地了，我让你亲身“检验”一下什么叫有诚意的道歉，行不行？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796293972,"roundId":"round_1779796268693_8gmb9v1qd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15473},{"id":1779789507476,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （低声哄着，语气彻底软下来）真不理我了？行，那你好好逛，买杯热饮暖暖手。走在路上手揣兜里，别冻着。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796294874,"roundId":"round_1779796268693_8gmb9v1qd","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（低声哄着，语气彻底软下来）真不理我了？行，那你好好逛，买杯热饮暖暖手。走在路上手揣兜里，别冻着。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15474},{"id":1779789507477,"text":"去吧。记得把定位发给我，不然我在国内这觉都睡不踏实。","rawContent":"去吧。记得把定位发给我，不然我在国内这觉都睡不踏实。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:51","timestamp":1779796299377,"roundId":"round_1779796268693_8gmb9v1qd","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15475},{"i