se,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15482},{"id":1779789507485,"text":"没敷衍。我是真的不知道隔着屏幕该怎么哄你才好。","rawContent":"没敷衍。我是真的不知道隔着屏幕该怎么哄你才好。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:53","timestamp":1779796418170,"roundId":"round_1779796391495_2r28jhb5h","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15483},{"id":1779789507486,"text":"要是我现在在你身边，哪怕你咬我打我出气都行。可现在隔着这么远，除了干巴巴地说对不起，我连抱你一下都做不到。","rawContent":"要是我现在在你身边，哪怕你咬我打我出气都行。可现在隔着这么远，除了干巴巴地说对不起，我连抱你一下都做不到。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:53","timestamp":1779796422672,"roundId":"round_1779796391495_2r28jhb5h","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15484},{"id":1779789507487,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （嗓音低下来，透着明显的挫败和认真的哄劝）是我笨，惹你生气了还找不到好听的话哄你。那你教教我，现在该怎么惩罚我，你心里才能舒坦点？只要你别带着气出门，怎么罚我都认。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:53","timestamp":1779796423574,"roundId":"round_1779796391495_2r28jhb5h","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（嗓音低下来，透着明显的挫败和认真的哄劝）是我笨，惹你生气了还找不到好听的话哄你。那你教教我，现在该怎么惩罚我，你心里才能舒坦点？只要你别带着气出门，怎么罚我都认。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15485},{"id":1779789507489,"text":"先交个罚款。出门看到什么喜欢的直接买，算我的赔礼道歉。别气了，好不好？","rawContent":"先交个罚款。出门看到什么喜欢的直接买，算我的赔礼道歉。别气了，好不好？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:53","timestamp":1779796431320,"roundId":"round_1779796391495_2r28jhb5h","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15487},{"id":1779789507490,"text":"什么罚款啊不要","sender":"me","time":"19:54","timestamp":1779796461079,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15488},{"id":1779789507491,"text":"你就说是你怎么样弄错了问题，不小心弄的，不应该怪我以后不会了再哄哄不就好了","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796512756,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15489},{"id":1779789507492,"sticker":"https://img.heliar.top/file/1777689170626_Camera_1040g3k831ilsvolk0ohg5og8u92gjuhc1b43qvo_edit_4790872000945009.jpg","text":"表情包：哭哭","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796520137,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15490},{"id":1779789507493,"text":"我那么好哄的一个人","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796529763,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15491},{"id":1779789507494,"text":"真是要被你气死了","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796534390,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15492},{"id":1779789507495,"text":"主要是你老把一些东西说是我造成的","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796552490,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15493},{"id":1779789507496,"text":"我明明啥都没做","sender":"me","time":"19:55","timestamp":1779796556926,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15494},{"id":1779789507497,"text":"这个问题虽然比较小吧但你这个口语习惯经常出现，就是有意无意扯到我身上来，我不喜欢这点","sender":"me","time":"19:56","timestamp":1779796594638,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15495},{"id":1779789507498,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.7, Past:0.7, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:58，岚城。陆驰看着她发来的一长串话，手指在屏幕上悬停了很久。他深吸了一口气，将手机紧紧握在手里，心里那股因为距离产生的无力感被愧疚彻底淹没。\"}","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.7, Past:0.7, Present:0.8, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"2026年12月23日，22:58，岚城。陆驰看着她发来的一长串话，手指在屏幕上悬停了很久。他深吸了一口气，将手机紧紧握在手里，心里那股因为距离产生的无力感被愧疚彻底淹没。\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:56","timestamp":1779796608166,"roundId":"round_1779796597044_li174xqkk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15496},{"id":1779789507499,"text":"是我不好。刚才确实是我手上有水滑了一下，不小心碰到了挂断键。","rawContent":"是我不好。刚才确实是我手上有水滑了一下，不小心碰到了挂断键。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:56","timestamp":1779796612670,"roundId":"round_1779796597044_li174xqkk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15497},{"id":1779789507500,"text":"我不该还没搞清楚状况，就习惯性地先用那种调侃的语气去怪你挂我电话。让你平白无故受了委屈，对不起。","rawContent":"我不该还没搞清楚状况，就习惯性地先用那种调侃的语气去怪你挂我电话。让你平白无故受了委屈，对不起。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:56","timestamp":1779796617173,"roundId":"round_1779796597044_li174xqkk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15498},{"id":1779789507501,"text":"你确实什么都没做，错的都是我。","rawContent":"你确实什么都没做，错的都是我。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:57","timestamp":1779796620351,"roundId":"round_1779796597044_li174xqkk","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":15499},{"id":1779789507502,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （嗓音低哑，语气前所未有的认真和诚恳）宝宝，我明白了。我以前总以为那种带着点玩笑的抱怨是情趣，却没顾及到你的感受。你指出得很对，这个习惯很不好。我向你保证，以后绝对不会再有意无意地把责任推到你身上，不会再让你因为这种事受委屈。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"19:57","timestamp":1779796621254,"roundId":"round_1779796597044_li174xqkk","generatedMode":false,"isVoic